# .env.example
# Copy this to .env for local development. Never commit .env or .env.production.
# Keep this file up to date — it is the team's documentation for required variables.

# Set automatically by Docker at build time (see Dockerfile / docker-compose*.yml) — you
# generally don't need this locally. `npm run build` defaults to "production" when unset.
# ELEVENTY_ENV=staging

# No other build-time env vars are currently required.

# Example, not yet in use — see CLAUDE.md before adding: Google Analytics
# GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
